casparser (MIT License)
https://github.com/codereverser/casparser

The statement parser in src/parser/ (classify.ts, header.ts, reconcile.ts, detect.ts, cams.ts) is a TypeScript port of
the CAMS / KFintech "Detailed" statement parser in casparser: its transaction classification, scheme-header reading,
running-balance reconciliation and issuer detection. tools/parser-oracle/ runs casparser as a development-time
reference for testing; it is not shipped and not a runtime dependency.

